────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Whose rules guard the agents
  Whose rules guard the agents: the OS sandbox, a container, each AI tool's own, or none at all. A role's own setting
  wins

  ❯ 1. Argonauts' (OS sandbox) ✓   Argonauts' rules, kept by your OS's own sandbox
    2. Argonauts' (container)      Argonauts' rules, in a container that holds only the agent's copy
    3. each AI tool's own          Each AI tool's own sandbox and approvals, with Argonauts' off
    4. none                        No protection at all, neither Argonauts' nor the tool's

  Enter to choose · ↑↓ to move · type to filter · Esc to close
